		"details": {
			"isComplex": true,
			"level": {
				"value": 12
			},
			"disable": "<p>@Check[type:intimidation|dc:35|name:Return Her Gaze] (expert) twice to impose your will on the wisp eyes; two wisps are destroyed on each successful check. Alternatively, @Check[type:occultism|dc:32|name:Steel Your Mind] (master) four times to create a ward against the haunt's mental influence; one wisp is destroyed on each successful check. </p>",
			"description": "<p class=\"p1\">The ongoing effect of investigating the machinations of Nhimbaloth and her servants moves from the realm of sleep to your waking moments. Ominous cracks in the fabric of reality appear before your eyes, fraying the edges of your sanity. You are no longer certain of who your friends are. Allies appear to shed their disguises and reveal themselves to be malevolent monsters.</p>",
			"reset": "<p>The haunt deactivates 1 minute after all creatures leave the area but resets immediately thereafter.</p>",
			"routine": "<p>(4 actions) For each action available, the haunt targets a creature with the Betrayal's Grasp ability. When a wisp is destroyed, reduce the number of actions for the routine by 1.</p>",
			"publication": {
				"title": "Pathfinder GM Core",
