		{
			"type": "action",
			"name": "Betrayal's Grasp",
			"system": {
				"actionType": {
					"value": "action"
				},
				"description": {
					"value": "<p>The haunt continues to confound victims’ senses and inspire them to commit violence against each other. </p><section class=\"statblock\"><p><strong>Target</strong> 1 creature in the haunt's area</p><p><strong>Save</strong> @Check[type:will|dc:32|showDC:all]{basic Will save}</p><p><strong>Damage</strong> @Damage[(3d10+14)[void]]{3d10+14 void damage}</p></section><hr /><section class=\"statblock\"><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9qGBRpbX9NEwtAAr]{Controlled} for 1 round and is exposed to the Your Lot, To Die curse.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is controlled for 1 minute and is exposed to the Your Lot, To Die curse.</p></section>",
